{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026etRPQyAwc21792745577.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日是二十四節氣的霜降，是入冬前最後一個節氣，天文台錄得32.3度，是1884年有紀錄以來最熱的霜降。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202361-%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%E9%8C%84323%E5%BA%A6%E7%82%BA%E6%9C%89%E7%B4%80%E9%8C%84%E4%BB%A5%E4%BE%86%E6%9C%80%E7%86%B1%E9%9C%9C%E9%99%8D\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>天文台錄32.3度　為有紀錄以來最熱霜降</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202334-%E9%9C%9C%E9%99%8D%E7%86%B1%E8%BE%A3%E8%BE%A3%E4%BB%8A%E5%8B%A2%E7%A0%B42006%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%80%E7%86%B1%E7%B4%80%E9%8C%84%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80%E6%9C%80%E5%87%8D%E9%9C%9C%E9%99%8D%E6%9C%89%E5%B9%BE%E5%87%8D\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>「霜降」熱辣辣　今勢破2006年最熱紀錄｜延伸閱讀‧最凍霜降有幾凍？</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>21年前執勤時遇襲癱瘓、上月離世的高級警員朱振國，以警隊最高榮譽喪禮舉殯，靈柩安葬浩園。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202340-%E6%9C%B1%E6%8C%AF%E5%9C%8B%E8%91%AC%E7%A6%AE%E4%BB%A5%E8%AD%A6%E9%9A%8A%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E6%A6%AE%E8%AD%BD%E5%96%AA%E7%A6%AE%E8%88%89%E6%AE%AF%E9%9D%88%E6%9F%A9%E5%AE%89%E8%91%AC%E6%B5%A9%E5%9C%92\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>朱振國葬禮｜以警隊最高榮譽喪禮舉殯　靈柩安葬浩園</strong></a></p><p></p><p>新皇崗口岸啟用後首個長假期，港方口岸出境一度出現人潮。保安局局長鄧炳強指，海關大堂有樽頸位，在長假期人流多時要再及早分流。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202320-%E9%84%A7%E7%82%B3%E5%BC%B7%E6%8C%87%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E6%B5%B7%E9%97%9C%E5%A4%A7%E5%A0%82%E6%9C%89%E6%A8%BD%E9%A0%B8%E4%BD%8D%E9%95%B7%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E4%BA%BA%E6%B5%81%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%82%E9%A0%88%E5%86%8D%E5%8F%8A%E6%97%A9%E5%88%86%E6%B5%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>鄧炳強指新皇崗口岸海關大堂有樽頸位　長假期人流多時須再及早分流</strong></a></p><p></p><p>「醫健通」平台推出十年，有議員建議與醫管局的「HA GO」合併，醫務衞生局局長盧寵茂認為兩者處理的服務不同，合併會市民難以應用。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202349-%E7%9B%A7%E5%AF%B5%E8%8C%82%E6%8C%87%E9%86%AB%E5%81%A5%E9%80%9A%E8%88%87HAGO%E5%85%A9%E8%80%85%E8%99%95%E7%90%86%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%90%88%E4%BD%B5%E8%AE%93%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E9%9B%A3%E4%BB%A5%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>盧寵茂指「醫健通」與「HA GO」兩者處理服務不同　合併讓市民難以應用</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:04.951429+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":392,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T17:38:10.446619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:15.762456+00:00","content_hash":"c21ee37bd64ace1c1cf0ab284096ecc07204da4afe6780ae9a02ee80a089e39d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:04.951429+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}